## Stack

- **Runtime:** Python 3.14 (`.python-version`), managed by [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/): uv installs Python, creates `.venv` and installs the exact versions from `uv.lock`. Never use `pip install`; use `uv add` / `uv remove`.
- **Bot:** [aiogram 3](https://docs.aiogram.dev) on asyncio — routers, filters, FSM (conversation states), `CallbackData` for inline buttons. Replies use HTML parse mode by default.
- **HTTP:** aiohttp (installed with aiogram) serves `GET /health`, the webhook endpoint and the development playground.
- **Data:** SQLite through `aiosqlite`, plain SQL migrations, no ORM.
- **Configuration:** `pydantic-settings` reads `.env` into a typed `Settings` object.
- **Tooling:** [Poe the Poet](https://poethepoet.natn.io) tasks in `pyproject.toml`, Ruff (lint + format), mypy `--strict` with the pydantic plugin, pytest with pytest-asyncio, watchfiles (restarts `dev` on changes).

